{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Dold–Thom 定理"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Dold–Thom定理"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>拓扑空间的约化"},{"Local":{"url":"同调","text":"同调"}},{"Plain":"同构于其生成的自由交换幺半群的"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦群","text":"同伦群"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>空间 $X$ 生成的自由交换幺半群可构造为<strong>无穷对称积</strong> (infinite symmetric product), 即对称积 $X^n / S_n$ 的余极限.</p>\n"}]}}